Managing Your Installed PWA
Android Management
Update the App:

Updates happen automatically in the background
Manual updates via browser if needed
Uninstall the App:

Long-press the Mekh icon on your home screen
Tap "Uninstall" or "Remove"
Confirm the removal
Clear App Data:

Go to Settings > Apps > Mekh > Storage > Clear data
iOS Management
Update the App:

Updates happen automatically
Force refresh by pulling down on the home screen
Remove the App:

Long-press the Mekh icon until it jiggles
Tap the minus (-) button
Confirm "Delete App"
Clear Website Data:

Settings > Safari > Advanced > Website Data > Find "mekh.app" > Swipe left to delete
