Frequently Asked Questions
Q: Is the PWA the same as the website? A: Yes, the PWA is the full Mekh website optimized for mobile app experience.

Q: Do I need to pay for the PWA? A: No, Mekh PWA is completely free to install and use.

Q: Can I have both the PWA and website bookmark? A: Yes, they can coexist. The PWA provides a better mobile experience.

Q: Does the PWA work offline? A: Yes, basic browsing and cached content work offline.

Q: How do I update the PWA? A: Updates happen automatically. You can also force refresh by pulling down on the home screen.

Q: Can I move the app icon? A: Yes, long-press and drag to rearrange on your home screen.

Q: What if I clear browser data? A: The PWA remains installed, but you may need to sign in again.

Q: Is my data safe in the PWA? A: Yes, Mekh uses the same security as the website with HTTPS encryption.

